---
import "../styles/global.css";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/layout/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer.astro";

// Last reviewed date is hard-coded so the page is stable across rebuilds and
// across user time-zones. Bump it whenever this document is revised.
const lastUpdated = "31 May 2026";

Astro.response.headers.set(
  "Cache-Control",
  "public, s-maxage=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800",
);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Sinclair Yachting"
  description="How Sinclair Yachting collects, uses, and protects the personal data you share with us."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="bg-warm-white">
    <!-- Editorial header -->
    <header class="pt-32 pb-14 sm:pt-36 sm:pb-16 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
        <nav
          class="text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-taupe-light"
          style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;"
        >
          <a href="/" class="transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-charcoal">Home</a>
          <span class="mx-3 text-taupe-light/60">/</span>
          <span class="text-charcoal">Privacy Policy</span>
        </nav>

        <h1
          data-reveal="up"
          class="mt-10 text-4xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
          style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
        >
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>

        <div data-reveal-line class="mt-8 h-px bg-gold"></div>

        <p
          data-reveal="up"
          class="mt-8 text-base font-light leading-[1.85] text-taupe sm:text-lg"
        >
          This page explains what personal data Sinclair Yachting collects when
          you use this website, why we collect it, and the rights you have over it.
        </p>

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-taupe-light"
          style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;"
        >
          Last updated &middot; <span class="num">{lastUpdated}</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Body -->
    <section class="pb-24 sm:pb-28 lg:pb-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
        <article class="space-y-12 text-base font-light leading-[1.85] text-taupe sm:text-[17px]">

          <!-- 1. Who we are -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              1. Who we are
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              In this policy, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo; and &ldquo;our&rdquo;
              refer to Sinclair Yachting (the &ldquo;Brokerage&rdquo;), a yacht
              brokerage operating from Palma de Mallorca, Spain. We are the data
              controller for personal data processed through this website.
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-taupe">
              <li>Paseo Marítimo 28, 3º &middot; 07014 Palma de Mallorca &middot; Illes Balears, Spain</li>
              <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@sinclairyachting.com" class="text-charcoal underline decoration-gold/40 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-gold">info@sinclairyachting.com</a></li>
              <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+447779130021" class="text-charcoal underline decoration-gold/40 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-gold">+44 7779 130021</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- 2. Data we collect -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              2. The data we collect
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>

            <h3 class="mt-6 text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;">
              a. Data you give us
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3">
              When you use the enquiry form on this site, we ask for:
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 marker:text-gold/60">
              <li>Your <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">name</strong>;</li>
              <li>An <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">email address or phone number</strong> (you choose which), so we can reply;</li>
              <li>The <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">message</strong> you send us &mdash; anything you choose to share about the charter, sale, build or service you&rsquo;re interested in.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4">
              When you reach out via the WhatsApp, email or phone links in the
              site, you also share whatever data those channels expose to us
              (your phone number, your email address, the contents of your
              message, and metadata your messaging app may attach).
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;">
              b. Data your browser stores locally
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3">
              The yacht catalogue caches public foreign-exchange rates in your
              browser&rsquo;s <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">localStorage</strong>
              under the key
              <code class="rounded bg-cream/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[13px] text-charcoal">sinclair:fx-rates</code>,
              refreshed roughly every six hours. This avoids re-fetching the
              same rates on every page load and lets us sort yachts by price
              even when prices are quoted in different currencies.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              This value stays on your device. It is not transmitted to us, it
              doesn&rsquo;t identify you, and you can clear it at any time from
              your browser&rsquo;s site-data settings.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;">
              c. Data collected automatically
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3">
              When you visit a website, your browser sends technical information
              that our hosting provider (see &sect;4) records for security and
              operational reasons. This typically includes your IP address,
              browser type and version, the page requested, the time of the
              request, and the referring URL. We do not use this data to build
              advertising profiles.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;">
              d. What we do <em>not</em> collect
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3">
              We do not use analytics or tracking pixels (no Google Analytics,
              no Meta Pixel, no Hotjar or similar). We do not set advertising
              cookies. We do not run session-replay tools. We do not buy or
              enrich your data from third parties.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 3. How we use it -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              3. How we use your data
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              We use the personal data you share with us only to:
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 marker:text-gold/60">
              <li>Reply to your enquiry and discuss the charter, yacht, sale, build or service you&rsquo;ve asked about;</li>
              <li>Prepare proposals, itineraries and quotes you request;</li>
              <li>Keep records required by Spanish commercial, tax and anti-money-laundering law where a transaction proceeds;</li>
              <li>Secure the site against abuse and keep it running.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4">
              Under the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), our legal
              bases are: your <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">consent</strong>
              (when you submit an enquiry), the
              <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">performance of pre-contractual measures</strong>
              you ask us to take, our
              <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">legitimate interest</strong>
              in keeping the website safe and operational, and our
              <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">legal obligations</strong>
              for record-keeping.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 4. Third parties -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              4. Third parties
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              We rely on a small number of service providers to operate the
              site. They process limited data on our behalf or, where you
              choose to interact with them, under their own terms:
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 marker:text-gold/60">
              <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Hosting</strong> &mdash; the site is served from Vercel Inc. (USA). Vercel processes request metadata (including IP) for delivery, caching and abuse prevention.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Google Fonts</strong> &mdash; fonts are loaded from <code class="rounded bg-cream/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[13px] text-charcoal">fonts.googleapis.com</code> and <code class="rounded bg-cream/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[13px] text-charcoal">fonts.gstatic.com</code>. Google may receive your IP address when fonts are fetched.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Unsplash</strong> &mdash; some imagery is served from <code class="rounded bg-cream/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[13px] text-charcoal">images.unsplash.com</code> or <code class="rounded bg-cream/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[13px] text-charcoal">plus.unsplash.com</code>. Unsplash may receive your IP address when images are loaded.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">WhatsApp / Meta</strong> &mdash; if you tap a WhatsApp link, your conversation is handled by WhatsApp under Meta&rsquo;s terms and privacy policy.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Email &amp; phone</strong> &mdash; messages sent to <a href="mailto:info@sinclairyachting.com" class="text-charcoal underline decoration-gold/40 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-gold">info@sinclairyachting.com</a> or to <a href="tel:+447779130021" class="text-charcoal underline decoration-gold/40 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-gold">+44 7779 130021</a> reach us through our email and telephony providers.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Ankor</strong> &mdash; we synchronise yacht specifications and availability from the Ankor charter platform. This sync runs server-side as part of our publishing process; your browser never contacts Ankor directly, and no data about you is sent to them.</li>
              <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Exchange-rate data</strong> &mdash; the currency converter uses public rates from open.er-api.com via a proxy on our own server. The upstream provider only sees a request from our server, not from you.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4">
              Some of these providers are based outside the European Economic
              Area. Where data is transferred internationally we rely on the
              appropriate safeguards, such as Standard Contractual Clauses or
              an adequacy decision, under Articles 45&ndash;49 GDPR.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 5. Cookies -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              5. Cookies
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              We do not set any cookies of our own. The single
              <code class="rounded bg-cream/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[13px] text-charcoal">sinclair:fx-rates</code>
              value described in &sect;2(b) is stored in your browser&rsquo;s
              localStorage and is strictly necessary for the catalogue&rsquo;s
              FX-conversion feature to function efficiently.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              Third parties listed in &sect;4 may set their own cookies under
              their own policies when their resources are loaded by your browser.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 6. Sharing -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              6. Who we share your data with
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              We do not sell your personal data and we don&rsquo;t share it for
              advertising purposes. We may share data only:
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 marker:text-gold/60">
              <li>With the yacht owner or management company strictly necessary to progress an enquiry you&rsquo;ve sent us;</li>
              <li>With our service providers in &sect;4 to the extent needed to operate the site;</li>
              <li>With professional advisors (e.g. legal, accounting) where required;</li>
              <li>With public authorities where the law requires it.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- 7. Retention -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              7. How long we keep your data
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              Enquiries that don&rsquo;t lead to a transaction are kept for up
              to <span class="num">24</span> months and then deleted, unless a
              shorter period applies on request. Where a charter, sale or build
              proceeds, we keep the related records for the period required by
              Spanish commercial and tax law (typically up to
              <span class="num">10</span> years). Server logs are kept for a
              short retention period set by our hosting provider.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 8. Your rights -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              8. Your rights
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              Under the GDPR and Spain&rsquo;s Organic Law
              <span class="num">3/2018</span> on Data Protection (LOPDGDD), you
              have the right to:
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 marker:text-gold/60">
              <li>Access the personal data we hold about you;</li>
              <li>Have inaccurate data rectified;</li>
              <li>Have your data erased where one of the GDPR grounds applies;</li>
              <li>Restrict or object to certain processing;</li>
              <li>Receive your data in a portable format;</li>
              <li>Withdraw a consent you previously gave us, without affecting prior processing;</li>
              <li>Lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD &mdash; <a href="https://www.aepd.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-charcoal underline decoration-gold/40 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-gold">www.aepd.es</a>).</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4">
              To exercise any of these rights, write to
              <a href="mailto:info@sinclairyachting.com" class="text-charcoal underline decoration-gold/40 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-gold">info@sinclairyachting.com</a>.
              We aim to respond within one month.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 9. Security -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              9. Security
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              The site is served over HTTPS. We apply technical and
              organisational measures appropriate to the limited data we
              handle. No transmission over the internet is ever entirely
              secure, however, and we cannot guarantee the absolute security
              of any data sent to us.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 10. Children -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              10. Children
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              This site is intended for adults. We don&rsquo;t knowingly
              collect personal data from anyone under <span class="num">16</span>.
              If you believe a child has sent us personal data, please contact
              us and we will delete it.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 11. Changes -->
          <div>
            <h2
              data-reveal="up"
              class="text-2xl font-light tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-charcoal"
              style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;"
            >
              11. Changes to this policy
            </h2>
            <div data-reveal-line class="mt-4 h-px bg-gold"></div>
            <p class="mt-6">
              We may revise this policy from time to time. When we do, we
              update the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date above and, for
              material changes, will take reasonable steps to bring the
              update to your attention.
            </p>
          </div>

        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
